{
  "_comment": [
    "Curated cross-tradition topics. Edit this file to change what the site offers as",
    "browsable themes; scripts/build-topics.js turns it into static/topics.json.",
    "",
    "Why curated rather than generated from the data: deities.domains holds 2,012",
    "distinct values, but the head is short and the tail is near-synonyms -",
    "'shapeshifting', 'shape-shifting' and 'shapeshifting (limited)' are one idea",
    "recorded three ways. Grouping by raw value would produce thousands of topics of",
    "one entity each. Grouping by curated theme with a synonym list produces a few",
    "dozen that a reader recognises.",
    "",
    "match:   whole words or phrases looked for in the fields listed under `fields`.",
    "         Matching is word-boundary, never substring: 'war' must not claim",
    "         'warmth', 'ward' or 'steward'.",
    "exclude: phrases that veto a match even when a `match` term hit. Use for the",
    "         cases where the same word means something else.",
    "",
    "An entity may belong to several topics - that is the point. A storm god who",
    "rules the sea appears under both, so there is more than one path to the page."
  ],
